@IssueTracker.api_HostAddress = https://localhost:8000

### Hämta alla supportärenden
GET {{IssueTracker.api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

### Skapa ett supportärende
POST {{IssueTracker.api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kan inte logga in",
  "description": "Användaren kan inte logga in i systemet.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Testa flera valideringsfel
POST {{IssueTracker.api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Hej",
  "description": "   ",
  "priority": "Urgent"
}

### Radera ett supportärende
DELETE {{IssueTracker.api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/4

### Uppdatera ett supportärende
PUT {{IssueTracker.api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Problem med inloggning",
  "description": "Inloggningen fungerar inte efter lösenordsbyte.",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Ändra status på ett supportärende
PATCH {{IssueTracker.api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/2
Content-Type: application/json-patch+json

[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/status",
    "value": "Closed"
  }
]